# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
# Anchored to the repo root: an unanchored "ntfy-to-slack" also matches the
# cmd/ntfy-to-slack/ source directory, silently hiding any new file added
# there (as happened with a new test file in this repo's own history).
/ntfy-to-slack

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Output of the go coverage tool, specifically when used with LiteIDE
*.out
coverage

